sequenceDiagram
    %% OVIC EON — API Authentication and RBAC Flow
    %% Document ID: EON-ARCH-DIAG-API-AUTH-001

    autonumber
    participant Client as API Client / Operator
    participant Gate as API Gateway / AuthMiddleware
    participant TokenStore as Token Validator / Keyring
    participant Router as API Endpoint Controller
    participant Core as Core Application Manager

    Client->>Gate: POST /api/v1/session/reset (Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    Gate->>TokenStore: Validate JWT Signature & Expiration (HS256)
    alt Token Invalid or Expired
        TokenStore-->>Gate: Token Verification Failed
        Gate-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (RFC 7807 JSON)
    else Token Valid
        TokenStore-->>Gate: Valid (User: "eng_operator", Role: "Operator")
        Gate->>Gate: Check RBAC policy (Operator role permitted for session reset)
        alt Insufficient Role Permissions
            Gate-->>Client: 403 Forbidden (Insufficient Privileges)
        else Authorized
            Gate->>Router: Forward request with RequestContext
            Router->>Core: reset_session_context()
            Core-->>Router: Operation Success
            Router-->>Client: 200 OK (ResetConfirmation)
        end
    end
